        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "There is no dispute at the Bar with respect to the legal position that disputes relating to quantum of compensation has to be referred to the Authority and decided as provided under section 64 of the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013.",
