        }
      ],
      "in_summary": false
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 15,
      "text": "3. Without going into the details of the facts submitted by learned counsel for the petitioners, it is directed that let the records of Land Acquisition Case no. 6 of 2010 be sent from the Court of learned Sub-Judge-I, Begusarai to the Presiding Officer, Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation & Resettlement Patna High Court CWJC No.4906 of 2018(2) dt.12-05-2023 Tribunal, Munger Division, Munger (respondent no.3) within a period of four weeks from today.",
      "rhetorical_role": "NONE",
      "start": 1168,
      "end": 1620,
